# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# DEFAULT-DENY. This repository is ~/.claude — a live Claude Code config that
# contains conversation transcripts, credentials and third-party code.
#
# Rule: deny everything, then allow only what is published. Anything new that
# appears in ~/.claude is ignored BY CONSTRUCTION — the possible mistake becomes
# "I forgot to publish a file" (annoying) instead of "I leaked a client
# transcript" (serious).
#
# Adding a new file to the repo takes TWO lines: allow its directory, then allow
# the file. Read the pattern below before adding anything.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# deny everything
/*
/**

# ── root files that are published ──
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/INSTALL.md
!/CLAUDE.md

# ── skills/ : only the eight authored here ──
# grill-me and grill-with-docs are NOT published (third party, Matt Pocock)
!/skills/
/skills/*
!/skills/init-project/
!/skills/epic/
!/skills/breakdown/
!/skills/feature/
!/skills/intake/
!/skills/review/
!/skills/eval/
!/skills/harness/
!/skills/*/SKILL.md
!/skills/*/*.md

# ── hooks/ : the three sensors plus the settings snippet ──
!/hooks/
/hooks/*
!/hooks/harness-route.sh
!/hooks/harness-drift.sh
!/hooks/harness-guard.sh
!/hooks/settings-snippet.json

# ── harness/ : the method documents ──
!/harness/
/harness/*
!/harness/FORMATS.md
!/harness/PRINCIPLES.md
!/harness/PROFILE.md
!/harness/LAYERS.md
!/harness/LEDGER.md

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Never published, and each for a reason. Listed explicitly as documentation —
# the /* /** above already denies them, but a reader deserves to know why.
#
#   projects/            transcripts of every conversation, including client work
#   sessions/            idem
#   history.jsonl        every prompt ever typed
#   .claude.json         MCP server config — may contain tokens
#   settings.json        personal: model, plugins, marketplaces
#   settings.local.json  idem
#   plugins/             third-party code
#   skills/grill-*       third party (Matt Pocock) — install from the source
#   todos/ tasks/ plans/ jobs/ ide/ session-env/ downloads/ backups/
#   cache/ paste-cache/ file-history/ shell-snapshots/ statsig/ telemetry/
#   *.log  daemon*       runtime noise
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
